11. Explicitly Out of Scope
Do not build these features during the initial competition release:
* User registration and authentication.
* Paid subscriptions or billing.
* Team collaboration.
* Shared cloud libraries.
* Browser extensions.
* Email or messaging integrations.
* Autonomous deletion, renaming, or moving of original files.
* Full OCR support for scanned documents.
* A general-purpose conversational chatbot.
* Complex multi-agent orchestration.
* Mandatory vector-database infrastructure.
* Model fine-tuning.
* Mobile-native applications.
* Claims of fully offline AI processing.
These features may be considered later if there is a clear user need.
