14. Definition of Done
ContextKeeper is complete for the Hacktoberfest MVP when a new user can upload a small collection of documents, allow Gemma to index them, retrieve a forgotten resource through a natural-language query, understand why the result matches, and inspect evidence from the original source—all through a polished, functional interface.
The product should save real effort, clearly demonstrate open-weight AI in action, and make no unsupported claims about privacy, model performance, or functionality.
Product principle: The user should not have to remember how they organized their information. ContextKeeper should help them find what they need with as little effort as possible.